<% content_for :title, "Not an operator" %>

<div class="card">
  <h1>You are signed in, but not as an operator</h1>
  <p class="muted">
    The Backoffice manages modules, domains, and the core itself. Your account
    (<span class="mono"><%= current_user&.email %></span>) does not have operator
    access, so there is nothing here for it to show you.
  </p>
  <p class="muted">Ask an operator to grant you access, or sign in with a different account.</p>
  <a class="button" href="<%= request.scheme %>://<%= current_domain.to_s.delete_prefix('admin.') %>/logout">Sign out</a>
</div>
